 during an  interview wolfgall said quote we're  referring to this as the halo silver  timeline as a way of differentiating it  from the core cannon and both protecting  core cannon and protecting the  television story and by that i mean  being able to give ourselves the chance  to evolve both and for both to be what  they need to be for their mediums  without colliding with each other the  halo series will launch on paramount  plus in 2022 is being produced by steven  spielberg's ambulant television and  stars pablo schreiber as master chief  switching gears to stalker 2 and it's  nft drama on december 15th gsc gameworld  developer of stalker revealed its  partnership with d-market to create a  metaverse for the franchise well that  news didn't sit well with fans and the  dev quickly pulled the plug on their  plan the gsc gameworld team issued a  message that said quote based on the  feedback we received we've made a  decision to cancel anything nfc related  in stalker 2. the interests of our fans  and players are top priority for the  team we're making this game for you to  enjoy whatever the cost is if you care  we care too prior to going back on their  plan gsc gameworld stressed that none of  the items offered would provide players  with an advantage in game and wouldn't  be required to play all of stalker 2's  content not sure what nfts are and why  so many people don't want them in games  well we made a video about it so check  that out for some useful information and  to see more of my face if you're into  that  but all right if you need me i'm gonna  go see spider-man and then binge the  witcher season 2 and then play some halo  let me know what you're getting into  [Music]
 

